muew-preset 2
name Digital Organ
category Keys
author MUEW Factory
tags organ drawbar bright clean
desc Drawbar-style organ: stacked sine and square with sub octave and a fast LFO for rotary shimmer.
osc1Shape 0
osc2Shape 3
osc2Detune 12
osc2Level 0.3
filterCutoff 9000
filterReso 0.1
filterMode 0
amp 0.005 0.1 1 0.08
mod 0.01 0.3 0 0.2
lfo1Rate 6.5
lfo1Shape 0
lfo2 0.35 1
warp1 0 0
warp2 0 0
mseg 1 0 4 0 0 0.15 1 0.55 -0.3 1 0
unison 1 1 0.1 0.1 0.5 0.7
sub 0.4 1 0
routes 8
route 0 9 0.3
route 0 3 0.1
route 5 2 3
route 6 5 0.7
route 6 6 0.7
route 7 4 4
route 8 1 0.3
route 8 3 0.25
chorus 1 0.4 6 14 0.3
delay 0 0.28 0.42 0.35 0.22
reverb 0 0.55 0.45 0.28
